{
  "book": "2nephi",
  "bookName": "2 Nephi",
  "chapter": 10,
  "voice": {
    "provider": "elevenlabs",
    "voice_id": "ddDFRErfhdc2asyySOG5",
    "model_id": "eleven_multilingual_v2",
    "settings": {
      "stability": 0.5,
      "similarity_boost": 0.75,
      "style": 0.35,
      "use_speaker_boost": true
    },
    "name": "Samuel"
  },
  "pauses": {
    "line_ms": 180,
    "verse_ms": 500
  },
  "duration": 369.276,
  "lines": [
    {
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 2.601,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now I, Jacob, speak unto you again,",
      "verse": "10:1",
      "lineIndex": 1
    },
    {
      "start": 2.781,
      "end": 4.453,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "my beloved brethren,",
      "verse": "10:1",
      "lineIndex": 2
    },
    {
      "start": 4.633,
      "end": 7.884,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "concerning this righteous branch of which I have spoken.",
      "verse": "10:1",
      "lineIndex": 3
    },
    {
      "start": 8.564,
      "end": 11.443,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "For behold, the promises which we have obtained",
      "verse": "10:2",
      "lineIndex": 4
    },
    {
      "start": 11.623,
      "end": 14.502,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "are promises unto us according to the flesh;",
      "verse": "10:2",
      "lineIndex": 5
    },
    {
      "start": 14.682,
      "end": 17.283,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "wherefore, as it has been shown unto me",
      "verse": "10:2",
      "lineIndex": 6
    },
    {
      "start": 17.463,
      "end": 22.479,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that many of our children shall perish in the flesh because of unbelief,",
      "verse": "10:2",
      "lineIndex": 7
    },
    {
      "start": 22.659,
      "end": 25.678,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "nevertheless, God will be merciful unto many;",
      "verse": "10:2",
      "lineIndex": 8
    },
    {
      "start": 25.858,
      "end": 27.994,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and our children shall be restored,",
      "verse": "10:2",
      "lineIndex": 9
    },
    {
      "start": 28.174,
      "end": 31.053,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that they may come to that which will give them",
      "verse": "10:2",
      "lineIndex": 10
    },
    {
      "start": 31.233,
      "end": 33.787,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "the true knowledge of their Redeemer.",
      "verse": "10:2",
      "lineIndex": 11
    },
    {
      "start": 34.467,
      "end": 36.417,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Wherefore, as I said unto you,",
      "verse": "10:3",
      "lineIndex": 13
    },
    {
      "start": 36.597,
      "end": 38.78,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "it must needs be expedient that Christ\u2014",
      "verse": "10:3",
      "lineIndex": 14
    },
    {
      "start": 38.96,
      "end": 43.511,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for in the last night the angel spake unto me that this should be his name\u2014",
      "verse": "10:3",
      "lineIndex": 15
    },
    {
      "start": 43.691,
      "end": 45.641,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "should come among the Jews,",
      "verse": "10:3",
      "lineIndex": 16
    },
    {
      "start": 45.821,
      "end": 49.118,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "among those who are the more wicked part of the world;",
      "verse": "10:3",
      "lineIndex": 17
    },
    {
      "start": 49.298,
      "end": 51.156,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and they shall crucify him\u2014",
      "verse": "10:3",
      "lineIndex": 18
    },
    {
      "start": 51.336,
      "end": 53.612,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for thus it behooveth our God,",
      "verse": "10:3",
      "lineIndex": 19
    },
    {
      "start": 53.792,
      "end": 58.25,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and there is none other nation on earth that would crucify their God.",
      "verse": "10:3",
      "lineIndex": 20
    },
    {
      "start": 58.93,
      "end": 63.202,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "For should the mighty miracles be wrought among other nations",
      "verse": "10:4",
      "lineIndex": 21
    },
    {
      "start": 63.382,
      "end": 66.215,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "they would repent, and know that he be their God.",
      "verse": "10:4",
      "lineIndex": 22
    },
    {
      "start": 66.895,
      "end": 69.774,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "But because of priestcrafts and iniquities,",
      "verse": "10:5",
      "lineIndex": 23
    },
    {
      "start": 69.954,
      "end": 73.205,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "they at Jerusalem will stiffen their necks against him,",
      "verse": "10:5",
      "lineIndex": 24
    },
    {
      "start": 73.385,
      "end": 74.825,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that he be crucified.",
      "verse": "10:5",
      "lineIndex": 25
    },
    {
      "start": 75.505,
      "end": 78.245,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Wherefore, because of their iniquities,",
      "verse": "10:6",
      "lineIndex": 26
    },
    {
      "start": 78.425,
      "end": 81.165,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "destructions, famines, pestilences,",
      "verse": "10:6",
      "lineIndex": 27
    },
    {
      "start": 81.345,
      "end": 83.76,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and bloodshed shall come upon them;",
      "verse": "10:6",
      "lineIndex": 28
    },
    {
      "start": 83.94,
      "end": 86.03,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and they who shall not be destroyed",
      "verse": "10:6",
      "lineIndex": 29
    },
    {
      "start": 86.21,
      "end": 88.857,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "shall be scattered among all nations.",
      "verse": "10:6",
      "lineIndex": 30
    },
    {
      "start": 89.537,
      "end": 91.766,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "But behold, thus saith the Lord God:",
      "verse": "10:7",
      "lineIndex": 32
    },
    {
      "start": 91.946,
      "end": 94.593,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "When the day cometh that they shall believe in me,",
      "verse": "10:7",
      "lineIndex": 33
    },
    {
      "start": 94.773,
      "end": 96.352,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that I am Christ,",
      "verse": "10:7",
      "lineIndex": 34
    },
    {
      "start": 96.532,
      "end": 105.82,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "then have I covenanted with their fathers that they shall be restored in the flesh, upon the earth, unto the lands of their inheritance.",
      "verse": "10:7",
      "lineIndex": 35
    },
    {
      "start": 106.5,
      "end": 110.076,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it shall come to pass that they shall be gathered in",
      "verse": "10:8",
      "lineIndex": 36
    },
    {
      "start": 110.256,
      "end": 114.064,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "from their long dispersion, from the isles of the sea,",
      "verse": "10:8",
      "lineIndex": 37
    },
    {
      "start": 114.244,
      "end": 116.427,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and from the four parts of the earth;",
      "verse": "10:8",
      "lineIndex": 38
    },
    {
      "start": 116.607,
      "end": 120.183,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and the nations of the Gentiles shall be great in the eyes of me,",
      "verse": "10:8",
      "lineIndex": 39
    },
    {
      "start": 120.363,
      "end": 124.728,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "saith God, in carrying them forth to the lands of their inheritance.",
      "verse": "10:8",
      "lineIndex": 40
    },
    {
      "start": 125.408,
      "end": 129.495,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Yea, the kings of the Gentiles shall be nursing fathers unto them,",
      "verse": "10:9",
      "lineIndex": 41
    },
    {
      "start": 129.675,
      "end": 132.461,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and their queens shall become nursing mothers;",
      "verse": "10:9",
      "lineIndex": 42
    },
    {
      "start": 132.641,
      "end": 136.96,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "wherefore, the promises of the Lord are great unto the Gentiles,",
      "verse": "10:9",
      "lineIndex": 43
    },
    {
      "start": 137.14,
      "end": 140.066,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for he hath spoken it, and who can dispute?",
      "verse": "10:9",
      "lineIndex": 44
    },
    {
      "start": 140.746,
      "end": 142.418,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "But behold, this land,",
      "verse": "10:10",
      "lineIndex": 46
    },
    {
      "start": 142.598,
      "end": 143.666,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "said God,",
      "verse": "10:10",
      "lineIndex": 47
    },
    {
      "start": 143.846,
      "end": 146.354,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "shall be a land of thine inheritance,",
      "verse": "10:10",
      "lineIndex": 48
    },
    {
      "start": 146.534,
      "end": 149.599,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and the Gentiles shall be blessed upon the land.",
      "verse": "10:10",
      "lineIndex": 49
    },
    {
      "start": 150.279,
      "end": 153.948,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And this land shall be a land of liberty unto the Gentiles,",
      "verse": "10:11",
      "lineIndex": 50
    },
    {
      "start": 154.128,
      "end": 156.914,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and there shall be no kings upon the land,",
      "verse": "10:11",
      "lineIndex": 51
    },
    {
      "start": 157.094,
      "end": 159.37,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "who shall raise up unto the Gentiles.",
      "verse": "10:11",
      "lineIndex": 52
    },
    {
      "start": 160.05,
      "end": 163.44,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And I will fortify this land against all other nations.",
      "verse": "10:12",
      "lineIndex": 53
    },
    {
      "start": 164.12,
      "end": 167.603,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And he that fighteth against Zion shall perish, saith God.",
      "verse": "10:13",
      "lineIndex": 54
    },
    {
      "start": 168.283,
      "end": 171.627,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "For he that raiseth up a king against me shall perish,",
      "verse": "10:14",
      "lineIndex": 55
    },
    {
      "start": 171.807,
      "end": 173.479,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for I, the Lord,",
      "verse": "10:14",
      "lineIndex": 56
    },
    {
      "start": 173.659,
      "end": 175.052,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "the king of heaven,",
      "verse": "10:14",
      "lineIndex": 57
    },
    {
      "start": 175.232,
      "end": 176.579,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "will be their king,",
      "verse": "10:14",
      "lineIndex": 58
    },
    {
      "start": 176.759,
      "end": 179.174,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and I will be a light unto them forever,",
      "verse": "10:14",
      "lineIndex": 59
    },
    {
      "start": 179.354,
      "end": 180.979,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that hear my words.",
      "verse": "10:14",
      "lineIndex": 60
    },
    {
      "start": 181.659,
      "end": 186.117,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Wherefore, for this cause, that my covenants may be fulfilled",
      "verse": "10:15",
      "lineIndex": 62
    },
    {
      "start": 186.297,
      "end": 189.548,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which I have made unto the children of men,",
      "verse": "10:15",
      "lineIndex": 63
    },
    {
      "start": 189.728,
      "end": 192.654,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that I will do unto them while they are in the flesh,",
      "verse": "10:15",
      "lineIndex": 64
    },
    {
      "start": 192.834,
      "end": 198.546,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "I must needs destroy the secret works of darkness, and of murders, and of abominations.",
      "verse": "10:15",
      "lineIndex": 65
    },
    {
      "start": 199.226,
      "end": 201.92,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Wherefore, he that fighteth against Zion,",
      "verse": "10:16",
      "lineIndex": 66
    },
    {
      "start": 202.1,
      "end": 203.818,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "both Jew and Gentile,",
      "verse": "10:16",
      "lineIndex": 67
    },
    {
      "start": 203.998,
      "end": 205.763,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "both bond and free,",
      "verse": "10:16",
      "lineIndex": 68
    },
    {
      "start": 205.943,
      "end": 208.265,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "both male and female, shall perish;",
      "verse": "10:16",
      "lineIndex": 69
    },
    {
      "start": 208.445,
      "end": 211.696,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for they are they who are the whore of all the earth;",
      "verse": "10:16",
      "lineIndex": 70
    },
    {
      "start": 211.876,
      "end": 215.638,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for they who are not for me are against me, saith our God.",
      "verse": "10:16",
      "lineIndex": 71
    },
    {
      "start": 216.318,
      "end": 221.241,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "For I will fulfil my promises which I have made unto the children of men,",
      "verse": "10:17",
      "lineIndex": 72
    },
    {
      "start": 221.421,
      "end": 224.115,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that I will do unto them while they are in the flesh\u2014",
      "verse": "10:17",
      "lineIndex": 73
    },
    {
      "start": 224.795,
      "end": 228.185,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Wherefore, my beloved brethren, thus saith our God:",
      "verse": "10:18",
      "lineIndex": 74
    },
    {
      "start": 228.365,
      "end": 231.43,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "I will afflict thy seed by the hand of the Gentiles;",
      "verse": "10:18",
      "lineIndex": 75
    },
    {
      "start": 231.61,
      "end": 234.768,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "nevertheless, I will soften the hearts of the Gentiles,",
      "verse": "10:18",
      "lineIndex": 76
    },
    {
      "start": 234.948,
      "end": 238.106,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that they shall be like unto a father to them;",
      "verse": "10:18",
      "lineIndex": 77
    },
    {
      "start": 238.286,
      "end": 243.116,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "wherefore, the Gentiles shall be blessed and numbered among the house of Israel.",
      "verse": "10:18",
      "lineIndex": 78
    },
    {
      "start": 243.796,
      "end": 247.047,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Wherefore, I will consecrate this land unto thy seed,",
      "verse": "10:19",
      "lineIndex": 79
    },
    {
      "start": 247.227,
      "end": 250.106,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and them who shall be numbered among thy seed,",
      "verse": "10:19",
      "lineIndex": 80
    },
    {
      "start": 250.286,
      "end": 253.026,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "forever, for the land of their inheritance;",
      "verse": "10:19",
      "lineIndex": 81
    },
    {
      "start": 253.206,
      "end": 255.11,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for it is a choice land,",
      "verse": "10:19",
      "lineIndex": 82
    },
    {
      "start": 255.29,
      "end": 258.355,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "saith God unto me, above all other lands,",
      "verse": "10:19",
      "lineIndex": 83
    },
    {
      "start": 258.535,
      "end": 261.879,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "wherefore I will have all men that dwell thereon",
      "verse": "10:19",
      "lineIndex": 84
    },
    {
      "start": 262.059,
      "end": 264.66,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that they shall worship me, saith God.",
      "verse": "10:19",
      "lineIndex": 85
    },
    {
      "start": 265.34,
      "end": 267.383,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now, my beloved brethren,",
      "verse": "10:20",
      "lineIndex": 87
    },
    {
      "start": 267.563,
      "end": 270.396,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "seeing that our merciful God has given us",
      "verse": "10:20",
      "lineIndex": 88
    },
    {
      "start": 270.576,
      "end": 273.223,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "so great knowledge concerning these things,",
      "verse": "10:20",
      "lineIndex": 89
    },
    {
      "start": 273.403,
      "end": 274.703,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "let us remember him,",
      "verse": "10:20",
      "lineIndex": 90
    },
    {
      "start": 274.883,
      "end": 276.648,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and lay aside our sins,",
      "verse": "10:20",
      "lineIndex": 91
    },
    {
      "start": 276.828,
      "end": 278.639,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and not hang down our heads,",
      "verse": "10:20",
      "lineIndex": 92
    },
    {
      "start": 278.819,
      "end": 280.677,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for we are not cast off;",
      "verse": "10:20",
      "lineIndex": 93
    },
    {
      "start": 280.857,
      "end": 286.29,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "nevertheless, we have been driven out of the land of our inheritance;",
      "verse": "10:20",
      "lineIndex": 94
    },
    {
      "start": 286.47,
      "end": 288.885,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "but we have been led to a better land,",
      "verse": "10:20",
      "lineIndex": 95
    },
    {
      "start": 289.065,
      "end": 291.759,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for the Lord has made the sea our path,",
      "verse": "10:20",
      "lineIndex": 96
    },
    {
      "start": 291.939,
      "end": 294.679,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and we are upon an isle of the sea.",
      "verse": "10:20",
      "lineIndex": 97
    },
    {
      "start": 295.359,
      "end": 297.96,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "But great are the promises of the Lord",
      "verse": "10:21",
      "lineIndex": 98
    },
    {
      "start": 298.14,
      "end": 301.205,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "unto them who are upon the isles of the sea;",
      "verse": "10:21",
      "lineIndex": 99
    },
    {
      "start": 301.385,
      "end": 303.428,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "wherefore as it says isles,",
      "verse": "10:21",
      "lineIndex": 100
    },
    {
      "start": 303.608,
      "end": 305.93,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "there must needs be more than this,",
      "verse": "10:21",
      "lineIndex": 101
    },
    {
      "start": 306.11,
      "end": 308.943,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and they are inhabited also by our brethren.",
      "verse": "10:21",
      "lineIndex": 102
    },
    {
      "start": 309.623,
      "end": 317.471,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "For behold, the Lord God has led away from time to time from the house of Israel, according to his will and pleasure.",
      "verse": "10:22",
      "lineIndex": 103
    },
    {
      "start": 317.651,
      "end": 319.137,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now behold,",
      "verse": "10:22",
      "lineIndex": 104
    },
    {
      "start": 319.317,
      "end": 322.521,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "the Lord remembereth all them who have been broken off,",
      "verse": "10:22",
      "lineIndex": 105
    },
    {
      "start": 322.701,
      "end": 325.023,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "wherefore he remembereth us also.",
      "verse": "10:22",
      "lineIndex": 106
    },
    {
      "start": 325.703,
      "end": 327.607,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Therefore, cheer up your hearts,",
      "verse": "10:23",
      "lineIndex": 107
    },
    {
      "start": 327.787,
      "end": 330.852,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and remember that ye are free to act for yourselves\u2014",
      "verse": "10:23",
      "lineIndex": 108
    },
    {
      "start": 331.032,
      "end": 335.722,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "to choose the way of everlasting death or the way of eternal life.",
      "verse": "10:23",
      "lineIndex": 109
    },
    {
      "start": 336.402,
      "end": 338.352,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Wherefore, my beloved brethren,",
      "verse": "10:24",
      "lineIndex": 110
    },
    {
      "start": 338.532,
      "end": 341.133,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "reconcile yourselves to the will of God,",
      "verse": "10:24",
      "lineIndex": 111
    },
    {
      "start": 341.313,
      "end": 344.61,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and not to the will of the devil and the flesh;",
      "verse": "10:24",
